  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, place haloumi and cover with water to soak.\n• Finely chop or crush garlic. In a medium saucepan, melt the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook 1/2 the garlic until fragrant, 1-2 mins. Add rice, the water and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil. Reduce heat to low, cover with a lid. Cook for 10 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and the water absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65029c4d898f5551090570c5-c54f1dec.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice carrot into half-moons.\n• Drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut into bite-size chunks.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65029c4d898f5551090570c5-a5009a25.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook haloumi, tossing, until golden brown, 3 mins. Transfer to a plate.\n• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook carrot until softened, 4-6 mins.\n• Add curry spice blend and remaining garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 min.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65029c4d898f5551090570c5-2a49ece3.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add passata, cooking cream and the brown sugar and cook until thickened, 2-3 mins.\n• Stir through haloumi and spinach until wilted. Season to taste.\n• Divide rice and curry between bowls. Sprinkle with flaked almonds to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65029c4d898f5551090570c5-8fef71bf.jpeg"
    }
  ]
